// What has not happened yet, for the forecast.
//
// Estimated tax for 2026 is paid from the vault ahead of the 1040-ES dates:
// 3_000 USD is a quarter of last year's total federal tax, rounded up. The last
// installment is planned for December, inside the year it pays for. A plan's
// `for 2026` is not carried into the forecast, so a January payment would count
// in the wrong year there. The SEP-IRA top-ups need no plan: they have come
// quarterly, and the forecast learns that from the journal.

every year on 06-14 from 2026-06-14 tax-vault -> federal 3_000 USD / irs
every year on 09-14 from 2026-09-14 tax-vault -> federal 3_000 USD / irs
every year on 12-30 from 2026-12-30 tax-vault -> federal 3_000 USD / irs
